{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"103824","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/103824","key":"MC-249664","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"28/Mar/22 12:37 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>This might be intentional as many mobs follow this rule, but it seems odd for the Warden.<br>\n <span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><a id=\"135590_thumb\" href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/135590\" title=\"screenshot-1.png\" file-preview-type=\"image\" file-preview-id=\"135590\" file-preview-title=\"screenshot-1.png\"><jira-attachment-thumbnail url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/135590?default=false\" jira-url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/135590\" filename=\"screenshot-1.png\"><img src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/135590\" data-attachment-name=\"screenshot-1.png\" data-attachment-type=\"thumbnail\" data-media-services-id=\"82e9ba0a-c130-4283-a4ed-1cac10a86a3e\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\"></jira-attachment-thumbnail></a></span> </p>\n\n<p><b>The bug:</b><br>\nIf the Warden is far away, the Warden has a chance to just despawn, even if you keep distracting it from a distance. The Warden is not digging down to despawn and it is instead just disappearing. </p>\n\n<p><b>Steps to reproduce:</b></p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Summon a warden</li>\n\t<li>/tp @s ~-130 ~ ~ -90 0</li>\n\t<li>/tp @s ~130 ~ ~ -90 0 (Or you can just fly back to where the warden was summoned)</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p><b>Observed results:</b><br>\nThe warden has despawned immediately because the warden is over 128 blocks away.<br>\nIt can also despawn randomly if it is in between 32 blocks and 128 blocks away as seen in the picture above.</p>\n\n<p><b>Expected results:</b><br>\nThe Warden should only despawn when digging into the ground.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"28/Mar/22 8:32 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/135586","id":"135586","filename":"Minecraft 22w12a Warden Despawning.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"Eometheous","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"customer"},"created":"28/Mar/22 12:36 PM","size":"9.37 MB","mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/135586"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/135587","id":"135587","filename":"Minecraft 22w15a - Multiplayer Warden Despawning.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"Eometheous","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"customer"},"created":"14/Apr/22 2:23 PM","size":"1.53 MB","mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/135587"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.n